  "beschreibung_html": "<p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:14px;\">一位叫杨飞的听众给我们的留言。他在看开言推送留言时，发现了一位自己<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;color:#007AAA;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;\">失散多年</span>的朋友。而且这个朋友也叫杨飞。</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:14px;color:#007AAA;\">真有缘啊！</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:14px;\">所以，今天这集节目：</span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:14px;\">1）Jenny, Adam就要说说<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;color:#007AAA;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;\">“缘分”<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;color:#000000;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;\">怎么用英语表达；</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:14px;\">2）也要帮这位<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;color:#007AAA;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;\">杨飞</span>找到另一位<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;color:#007AAA;box-sizing:border-box !important;word-wrap:break-word !important;\">杨飞</span>。如果这个人是你，听完节目联系我们吧！</span></p><span><br /></span><p><span>今天节目的关键词、文本、翻译和更多最新英语学习内容，请下载全新app「<span>开言英语</span>」或请关注微信公众号: 开言英语，回复“缘分”查看。</span></p><br />",
